# Research agents occasionally drop scratch downloads in the repo root.
# Never commit them — one was a full copyrighted book text (2026-08-25).
/*.txt
/*.html
!requirements*.txt

# Research agents keep dropping scratch downloads in the repo root. A full
# copyrighted book text was nearly committed once; a Google Books error blob was
# committed today. Agents are told to use the scratch dir; this is the backstop.
/*.json
!package.json
